# Dumps and variables are the STATE OF REAL BOARDS: boot entries, disk serial
# numbers, the memory configuration of that particular board. They are not
# published, not even to make life easier for someone trying the tool out.
material/
*.rom
*.ROM
*.bin

# Screenshots: only the ones the program GENERATES from its own pixels
# (BiosView.export_png) belong here. Anything captured off a real desktop can
# catch whatever else was on screen, and must not be committed.

